Tool purpose: 

A MOPA Laser is a laser that gives extreme control over the waveform generated while still giving fine control over power by varying the width of the pulse and giving high power amplification. The MOPA uses a fiber laser to maintain integrity. This system has control over the intensity and pattern of the laser output. 

Our Use:

We used the MOPA to clean the paint and stain off the cabinet, as well as cleaning the rust off the old tools. This was just an introductory job for this tool, as we were just getting used to using it. 
